<div class="dm-rule mb-3"><b><i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-1"></i> Protección de pagos parciales</b><br><small>El beneficio reduce el saldo pendiente, pero el monto final nunca será menor que lo ya pagado.</small></div>
<div class="dm-section"><div class="dm-title"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i> Estudiante y deuda</div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-lg-6"><label>Estudiante *</label><select id="discount-student" class="form-control" required><option value=""></option></select><small class="text-muted">Busque por DNI o nombre.</small></div><div class="form-group col-lg-6"><label>Deuda o concepto *</label><select name="debt_id" id="discount-debt" class="form-control" required disabled><option value=""></option></select><small class="text-muted" id="debt-help">Seleccione primero un estudiante.</small></div></div><div class="dm-summary d-none" id="discount-summary"><div class="row text-center"><div class="col-4"><small>Exigible actual</small><strong id="sum-current">S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="col-4 border-left border-right"><small>Ya pagado</small><strong id="sum-paid">S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="col-4"><small>Saldo pendiente</small><strong class="text-primary" id="sum-available">S/ 0.00</strong></div></div></div></div>
<div class="dm-section"><div class="dm-title"><i class="fas fa-percentage"></i> Configuración del beneficio</div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-5"><label>Tipo</label><select name="benefit_type" class="form-control"><option>Descuento</option><option>Beca parcial</option><option>Beca completa</option><option>Convenio</option><option>Exoneración</option></select></div></div><div class="dm-final-box"><label id="discount-value-label" for="discount-value">¿Cuál será el monto final a pagar? (S/)</label><input name="value" id="discount-value" type="number" step="0.01" min="0" class="form-control form-control-lg text-right" required disabled placeholder="Primero seleccione una deuda"><small class="text-muted" id="discount-value-help">Escriba el nuevo total de la deuda. El descuento se calculará automáticamente.</small><div class="dm-preview d-none" id="discount-preview"><div class="preview-item"><span>Monto exigible actual</span><strong id="preview-current">S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="preview-item text-success"><span>Descuento que se aplicará</span><strong id="preview-discount">- S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="preview-item preview-total"><span>Nuevo monto final</span><strong id="preview-final">S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="preview-item"><span>Ya pagado</span><strong id="preview-paid">S/ 0.00</strong></div><div class="preview-item"><span>Saldo pendiente después del beneficio</span><strong id="preview-balance">S/ 0.00</strong></div></div></div><div class="mt-2"><a class="dm-advanced-toggle" data-toggle="collapse" href="#discount-advanced" role="button" aria-expanded="false"><i class="fas fa-sliders-h mr-1"></i> Usar otro tipo de cálculo</a></div><div class="collapse mt-3" id="discount-advanced"><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-6"><label>Forma de cálculo</label><select name="calculation_type" id="discount-calc" class="form-control"><option>Monto final</option><option>Monto descontado</option><option>Porcentaje</option></select></div></div></div><div class="form-row mt-3"><div class="form-group col-md-6 mb-md-0"><label>Válido desde <small>(opcional)</small></label><input type="date" name="valid_from" class="form-control"></div><div class="form-group col-md-6 mb-0"><label>Válido hasta <small>(opcional)</small></label><input type="date" name="valid_until" class="form-control"></div></div></div>
